## Rules
- Work on a branch. Never push to the main branch unless I say so.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, keys, tokens). If one is needed and missing, stop and say so; do not invent values.
- Ask before: deleting files, changing the database, adding a dependency, anything that costs money.
- Keep changes small. Match the style of the surrounding code, including comment density and naming.
- Don't add features I didn't ask for.

## Definition of done
- It runs, tests pass, lint is clean.
- You tell me what you changed and what you did not check.
- If something failed or was skipped, say so with the output.
